<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25743" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lānātus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		lana, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>furnished with wool, bearing wool, woolly</i> (mostly <b>poet.</b> and post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lanatae oves,</span>”
				i. e. <i>unshorn</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					7, 3, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pelles,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 6,
					2, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">de lanata pelle,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Veg. 3, 7, 1</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">5, 42, 2</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">animalia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					15, 11</span></i>
			.—<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lānātae</span></b> ,
				ārum, f., <i>wool-bearers</i>, for <i>sheep</i>, <i><span class="en">Juv. 8,
			155</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitis,</span>”
				<i>downy, covered with down</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Col. 3,
					2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mala,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					15, 14, 14, § 48</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lupus,</span>”
				<i>soft like wool</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. 9,
					17, 28, § 61</span></i>
			.—<i>Comp.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">folia lanatiore canitie,</span>”
				<i>white like wool</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					21, 20, 84, § 147</span></i>
			.—Prov.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dii lanatos pedes habent,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the vengeance of the gods comes
					noiselessly</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 44 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
